<p>The Injury System, <strong class="selflink">sys_injury</strong>, uses special, permanently applied effects to a party member to mimic last damage sustained when dropping in combat.
</p><p>Injury effects are normal effects, however they are applied with an id of 50000 (INJURY_SPELL_ID) + injury index.
</p>
